    <div id="browserCompatModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md" onclick="closeBrowserCompatModal()"></div>
      <div class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-xl bg-[#161c24] border border-amber-500/40 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl text-neutral-200 space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                🦁
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-white">
                  Guardar Directo en <code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">Documents\iRacing\setups</code>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-amber-300 font-semibold mt-0.5" id="browserModalSubtitle">
                  Brave desactiva por defecto la API de acceso a carpetas locales
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" onclick="closeBrowserCompatModal()" class="text-neutral-400 hover:text-white p-1">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Option 1: Open in Edge / Chrome -->
          <div class="bg-[#0e1217] border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">
                Opción 1 (Más Rápida · Sin Configurar Nada)
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300">Recomendado</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
              Abre el Vault con <strong>Microsoft Edge</strong> o <strong>Google Chrome</strong>. En ambos navegadores la descarga directa en la ruta exacta de cada coche y circuito viene activada de fábrica.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
              <a
                href="microsoft-edge:https://muntru.me/setups"
                class="flex-1 py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-neutral-950 font-black text-xs text-center transition shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20"
              >
                🚀 Abrir ahora en Microsoft Edge
              </a>
              <button
                type="button"
                onclick="copyVaultUrlForChrome()"
                class="py-2.5 px-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#161c24] hover:bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-xs font-bold text-white transition"
              >
                📋 Copiar URL para Chrome
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Option 2: Enable in Brave in 10 seconds -->
          <div class="bg-[#0e1217] border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400">
                Opción 2 · Activar Guardado Directo en Brave (10 seg)
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-400">Solo se hace 1 vez</span>
            </div>
            <ol class="text-xs text-neutral-300 space-y-1.5 list-decimal list-inside leading-relaxed">
              <li>Pulsa el botón de abajo para copiar la dirección interna de Brave:</li>
              <li>Pégala en una pestaña nueva de Brave y pulsa <strong>Enter</strong>.</li>
              <li>Cambia <strong>File System Access API</strong> a <strong class="text-emerald-400">Enabled</strong> y pulsa <strong>Relaunch</strong>.</li>
            </ol>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
              <code class="flex-1 bg-[#161c24] border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-mono text-amber-300 select-all truncate">
                brave://flags/#file-system-access-api
              </code>
              <button
                type="button"
                onclick="copyBraveFlagUrl()"
                class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 font-black text-xs transition shrink-0"
              >
                📋 Copiar Flag de Brave
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Option 3: Automatic ZIP with exact folder structure + 1-click bat installer -->
          <div class="bg-[#0e1217] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-[11px] text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            💡 <strong class="text-white">Descarga con Ruta Exacta garantizada:</strong> Aunque descargues sin vincular carpeta, el sistema empaqueta automáticamente la estructura completa <code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">&lt;coche&gt;\Garage 61 - Muntrume Motorsport\&lt;semana_circuito&gt;\</code> junto con un auto-instalador <code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">Instalar_en_iRacing.bat</code> que coloca todo en su sitio con un doble clic.
          </div>

          <div class="flex justify-end">
            <button
              type="button"
              onclick="closeBrowserCompatModal()"
              class="px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-xs font-bold text-white transition"
            >
              Entendido
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

